        "TileImage": "$($repository 87ab7e2c-cdae-4566-b32e-75bc9cea84fd).Image",
        "Description": "47, you have been tasked with eliminating three targets. First is Theron Wiliams, a former weapons manufacturer who is quite fond of swords. The Second is Lance Brown Hanson, a former CIA agent who went into underground information brokering. Finnaly, you have the southern belle Susan Wilson, a master of explosives who is quite trusting of new people and loves to chat. \r\rThe client has told us they can all be found in Whittleton Creek. He would like for their deaths to be like those they caused.",
